  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORSTIP - Scholarship scheme for students from selected partner countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through student mobility to Norwegian higher education institutions, the scheme aims to educate qualified candidates for the workforce in the students&apos; home countries and to strengthen knowledge in subject areas needed by the partner countries.</narrative>
